```console
$ scherzo-cloud project repository set --help
Bind or replace a project's repository

Usage: scherzo-cloud project repository set [OPTIONS] --installation-id <INSTALLATION> --repository-id <REPOSITORY> <ORGANIZATION> <PROJECT>

Arguments:
  <ORGANIZATION>  Organization ID or exact slug
  <PROJECT>       Exact project ID

Options:
      --installation-id <INSTALLATION>
          Exact GitHub installation binding ID
      --repository-id <REPOSITORY>
          Exact provider repository ID
      --default-branch <DEFAULT_BRANCH>
          Set the configured default branch (the provider default when omitted)
      --json
          Print the project result as JSON
      --allow-insecure-http
          Allow this command's Scherzo Cloud requests over insecure HTTP connections
  -h, --help
          Print help

```
